  "bodyHash": "b912fa04ad3e0c76",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">践踏一切（Trample Everything）是一个改变玩家与世界互动方式的模组。你知道在默认情况下，不蹲下时作物会被踩踏。此模组将该功能扩展到了世界上的更多方块上。它具有高度可配置性。<br><br>默认情况下，以下方块会被踩踏：<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>&nbsp; 农作物、枯死灌木、双层植物、花朵、（下界）蘑菇、下界根茎、下界芽、下界疣、树苗、海泡菜、（南瓜/西瓜）藤蔓和高草丛。</em></span> <br><br>默认情况下，以下方块不会被踩踏：<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>&nbsp; 雪、竹笋、睡莲、海草、甘蔗和甜浆果丛。</em></span></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_enableTrampledBlockItems</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，踩踏方块时将掉落物品，就像玩家徒手破坏它一样。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_crouchingPreventsTrampling</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，蹲下/潜行将防止任何方块被踩踏。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSnow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏雪。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleBambooSaplings</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏竹笋。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleCrops</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏可生长的农作物。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleDeadBushes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏枯死灌木。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleDoublePlants</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏双层植物，例如高花。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleFlowers</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏花朵。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleFungi</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏下界蘑菇。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleLilyPads</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏睡莲。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏蘑菇。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleNetherRoots</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏下界根茎。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleNetherSprouts</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏下界芽。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleNetherWart</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏下界疣。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSaplings</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏树苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSeaGrass</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏海草。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSeaPickles</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏海泡菜。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleStems</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏藤蔓，例如南瓜和西瓜藤蔓。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSugarCane</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏甘蔗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSweetBerryBushes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏甜浆果丛。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleTallGrass</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允许踩踏高草丛。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冲刺时踩踏草和花朵：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/trample-everything/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"544\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在新下界更新中也能正常工作：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/trample-everything/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"544\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">也适用于耕地：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/trample-everything/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">默认情况下，蹲下/潜行会阻止踩踏：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/trample-everything/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在这么多单独的模组页面上跟踪评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何内容，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
